        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sectoris Sky takes you to a fantastical world suspended in the skies. Explore the floating islands, teeming with mysteries, resources, and formidable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by allocating your experience points to various stats like health, stamina, and more, to shape your own unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight creatures to obtain resources and equipment. Each piece of equipment has randomized stats, making every loot unique. If you don't like the stats, you can reforge them using the reforging system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sectoris Sky, the path to power lies through exploration and combat. Become master of the skies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sectoris Sky is constantly evolving. New content, features, and optimizations will be added regularly.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sectoris Sky takes you to a fantastical world suspended in the skies. Explore the floating islands, teeming with mysteries, resources, and formidable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character by allocating your experience points to various stats like health, stamina, and more, to shape your own unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight creatures to obtain resources and equipment. Each piece of equipment has randomized stats, making every loot unique. If you don't like the stats, you can reforge them using the reforging system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sectoris Sky, the path to power lies through exploration and combat. Become master of the skies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sectoris Sky is constantly evolving. New content, features, and optimizations will be added regularly.</p>",
        "short_description": "Sectoris Sky takes you to a fantastical world suspended in the skies. Explore the floating islands, teeming with mysteries, resources, and formidable enemies.",
